.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Test that the columns in which no cell starts (i.e. that exist only because cells span over them) are not
.# rendered, the column spans being reduced accordingly. This avoids generating a huge table for large column spans.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|(% colspan="5" %)h
|a|(% colspan="1000" %)b
|c|d|e

|(% colspan="2" %)a|b
|(% colspan="2" %)c|d
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|     |     |     |
| --- | --- | --- |
|       h       |||
|  a  |    b     ||
|  c  |  d  |  e  |

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
|  a  |  b  |
|  c  |  d  |
